">\ud83d\udcc5 31 Jan \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 10:00 \u2022 240m D+<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00f5es Abertas:<\/strong> Oficial Stop&#038;Go<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 limite de vagas)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada SMAT 10 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 31 Jan \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 10:10<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00f5es Abertas:<\/strong> Oficial Stop&#038;Go<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 limite de vagas)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Kids<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Trail Kids 5 km (100m D+)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 31 Jan \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 11:00 \u2022 100m D+<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00f5es Jovens:<\/strong> Oficial Stop&#038;Go<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 limite de vagas)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o Santa Maria Trail SMAT 2027?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento realiza-se no domingo, <strong>31 de Janeiro de 2027<\/strong>, no concelho de <strong>Vila do Porto<\/strong>, na Ilha de Santa Maria (A\u00e7ores).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e desn\u00edveis acumulados?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento conta com o <strong>Trail Longo 35 km (1820m D+)<\/strong>, <strong>Trail Curto 20 km (900m D+)<\/strong>, <strong>Mini Trail 10 km (240m D+)<\/strong>, <strong>Caminhada 10 km<\/strong> e <strong>Trail Kids 5 km<\/strong>.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">A prova integra circuitos certificados de Trail?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim, a prova \u00e9 certificada pela <strong>ATRP<\/strong> e cumpre os crit\u00e9rios t\u00e9cnicos nacionais de trail running.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui almo\u00e7o conv\u00edvio?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim, a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui o tradicional almo\u00e7o conv\u00edvio no final (com op\u00e7\u00e3o normal ou vegetariana).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso realizar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o oficial?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es realizam-se online atrav\u00e9s da plataforma <a href=\"https:\/\/stopandgo.net\/events\/santa-maria-trail-smat-2027\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Stop&#038;Go<\/a>.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Santa Maria Trail \u2013 SMAT 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-01-31\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Vila do Porto, Ilha de Santa Maria, A\u00e7ores\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Vila do Porto\", \"addressRegion\": \"A\u00e7ores\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Casa do Povo de S\u00e3o Pedro e Munic\u00edpio de Vila do Porto\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza o Santa Maria Trail SMAT 2027?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento realiza-se no domingo, 31 de Janeiro de 2027 , no concelho de Vila do Porto , na Ilha de Santa Maria (A\u00e7ores).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e desn\u00edveis acumulados?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento conta com o Trail Longo 35 km (1820m D+) , Trail Curto 20 km (900m D+) , Mini Trail 10 km (240m D+) , Caminhada 10 km e Trail Kids 5 km .\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"A prova integra circuitos certificados de Trail?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Sim, a prova \u00e9 certificada pela ATRP e cumpre os crit\u00e9rios t\u00e9cnicos nacionais de trail running.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui almo\u00e7o conv\u00edvio?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Sim, a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui o tradicional almo\u00e7o conv\u00edvio no final (com op\u00e7\u00e3o normal ou vegetariana).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde posso realizar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o oficial?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es realizam-se online atrav\u00e9s da plataforma Stop&Go .\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":66330,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,624,22,497,498],"event_type_2":[104,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-44443","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-ilha-de-santa-maria-acores","event_type-caminhada","event_type-kids","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_type-trail-longo","event_type_2-acores","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/santa-maria-trail-smat-2027.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/44443","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embed